## Notes for this layout
{% if project_layout == "ml" %}
- Notebooks under `notebooks/` are executed by the test suite; keep them runnable, or they fail the build.
- Anything under `data/` is ignored by version control. Do not commit datasets.
- The Metaflow flow runs locally with no cloud account; keep it that way.
{% elif project_layout == "dataeng" %}
- The Kedro pipeline runs locally against the in-memory catalog in `conf/base/catalog.yml`.
- Anything under `data/` is ignored by version control. Do not commit datasets.
- Kedro telemetry is declined in `.telemetry`; leave it declined unless the owner opts in.
{% elif project_layout == "service" %}
- The service exposes a health endpoint at `/health` and its OpenAPI docs at `/docs`.
- It runs locally with `uvicorn {{ python_package_import_name }}.app:app --reload`; it needs no external service to start.
{% endif -%}
